摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Company Is a Word. 一句话开一家AI公司 - open-source multi-agent orchestration framework for non-developers. 小白5分钟拥有自己的AI公司，可DIY任意行业、调教子Agent、无限家公司，支持飞书遥控。MIT","id":"gh:1338385684","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"ai-company-framework","slug":"yyyy231209/ai-company-framework","topics":["agent-framework","agent-orchestration","ai-agents","automation","business-automation","deepseek","dsh-plugin","llm","multi-agent","no-code","open-source","sub-agents","workflow-automation"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Company Is a Word. 一句话开一家AI公司 - open-source multi-agent orchestration framework for non-developers. "},{"id":"p1s2","text":"小白5分钟拥有自己的AI公司，可DIY任意行业、调教子Agent、无限家公司，支持飞书遥控。MIT"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# AI Company Framework"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"> **Company Is a Word.** — Say one sentence, get a working multi-agent company."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"English | 简体中文"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## ✨ What it is — in 30 seconds"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"A DeepSeek Harness `dsh.bundle` that turns **one sentence** into a **company of role-specialized age"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"nts** (writer, editor, developer, QA, sales, customer service…) that designs, schedules, quality-che"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"cks and delivers — while **you stay in charge of every major decision**."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## ⚡ 30-second quick start"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"That's it. The boss agent takes it from there."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"| AgentTeams activity | Employee sidebar | Company created |"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## 🎯 Why it stands out"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"| Advantage | What you get |"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"| **Zero impact on daily chat** | Company mode is **off by default** — `/company` to enable, `/no-co"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"mpany` to disable. Your normal conversations are untouched until you opt in. |\n| **Customer memory t"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"hat follows the customer** | SQLite per-customer profiles (id-isolated) + company/general memory. Th"},{"id":"p15s4","text":"e same customer across private chat and **multiple groups is automatically merged into one profile**"},{"id":"p15s5","text":", shared by every client-facing role — **nobody asks the customer to repeat themselves**. |\n| **Agen"},{"id":"p15s6","text":"ts push to you — you don't poll** | After \"let me check\", the agent reads its own output and **proac"},{"id":"p15s7","text":"tively sends** the result. No polling, no \"did you get it?\". |\n| **Humans own big decisions** | Pric"},{"id":"p15s8","text":"ing exceptions, refunds, commitments, legal/PR → a **human decision gate** pushes the choice to your"},{"id":"p15s9","text":" phone via Feishu; **nothing lands until you approve**. |\n| **One bot per employee** | Create a Feis"},{"id":"p15s10","text":"hu bot for the boss *and any employee* with one scan (registerApp) — perfect for remote work and cli"},{"id":"p15s11","text":"ent-facing teams. |\n| **Hardened conversation isolation** | Sidebar state is session-scoped (fail-cl"},{"id":"p15s12","text":"osed), model reconfiguration is ownership-checked (403), customer archives are id-isolated. No cross"},{"id":"p15s13","text":"-company leaks. |\n| **Open-source safe** | The package ships **zero user data** — databases, logs an"},{"id":"p15s14","text":"d credentials (DPAPI-encrypted) are created locally at first use. |\n| **Memory mode per role** | `三层"},{"id":"p15s15","text":"` (three-layer, client-facing) or `单层` (single, internal) — declared in each role skeleton. |"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## 🏭 Use cases"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"- **Ecommerce content studio** — research → copywriting → QA → rework → delivery, batched into one d"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"eliverable.\n- **Game studio** — designer plans, writer writes store copy, QA gates, customer service"},{"id":"p17s3","text":" handles clients with full customer memory.\n- **Customer support & sales** — per-customer archives +"},{"id":"p17s4","text":" cross-group merge + autonomous push + human decision gate.\n- **Remote team** — every employee can h"},{"id":"p17s5","text":"ave their own Feishu bot; you steer from your phone.\n- **Agency / outsourcing** — one-sentence onboa"},{"id":"p17s6","text":"rding per client, isolated companies per session."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## 📦 What's in the box (v0.3.10)"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"**15 flat Skills** (all gated by `/company`):"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"| Skill | Role |"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"| `company-boss` | Boss — architecture, scheduling, QA loop, delivery, wisdom |\n| `company-pipeline`"},{"id":"p21s2","text":" | 8-stage automation pipeline (build/feishu/schedule/QC/deliver/hire) |\n| `company-role-template` |"},{"id":"p21s3","text":" Role-skeleton template (self-written skills by employees) |\n| `company-customer-memory` | Generic t"},{"id":"p21s4","text":"hree-layer memory for any client-facing role |\n| `role-writer / role-editor / role-coder / role-rese"},{"id":"p21s5","text":"archer / role-qa / role-ops / role-finance / role-hr / role-data / role-translator / role-customer-s"},{"id":"p21s6","text":"ervice` | Prebuilt role skills |"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Plus:\n- **7 workflow templates** (`core/templates/`).\n- **AgentTeams runtime + web activity panel** "},{"id":"p22s2","text":"(bundled dependency, own Cordis row).\n- **Employee sidebar (host + web UI)**: lossless per-member mo"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"del routing, live session/tool view, messaging, session isolation, activity-panel restore.\n- **Feish"},{"id":"p22s4","text":"u bot bridge (host + web UI)**: official registerApp one-scan onboarding, DPAPI credentials, boss + "},{"id":"p22s5","text":"per-employee bots, private/group routing, two-way logs, boss auto-reply, autonomous push, human deci"},{"id":"p22s6","text":"sion gate, external-contact guide, full-coverage scopes + `extraScopes`.\n- **Customer memory**: `cor"},{"id":"p22s7","text":"e/scripts/customer-memory.mjs` (Node built-in SQLite, zero deps) — per-customer profiles + message l"},{"id":"p22s8","text":"og, three-layer memory, cross-group/private merge, one-shot full customer pull.\n- **Company mode swi"},{"id":"p22s9","text":"tch**: `/company` / `/no-company` commands + `company_mode` tool.\n- **No RAG, no vector database, no"},{"id":"p22s10","text":"any` / `/no-company` commands + `company_mode` tool.\n- **No RAG, no vector database, no telemetry.**"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## 🏗️ Architecture & boundaries"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"- Models/tools/sessions/Skills/Bundle runtime come from DeepSeek Harness; the rest is **implemented "},{"id":"p25s2","text":"by this Bundle** and activates on install.\n- Honest-state rule: anything not installed/authorized/on"},{"id":"p25s3","text":"line is shown as such with onboarding guidance — never falsely reported ready."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## 🛡️ Security"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"- Zero user data in the package (verified: no `.db`/`.jsonl` in the tarball).\n- Feishu App Secrets: "},{"id":"p27s2","text":"**Windows DPAPI**, CurrentUser scope, local only; `connected` only when a real WebSocket is up.\n- Cu"},{"id":"p27s3","text":"stomer archives: per-id isolation; sidebar: per-session fail-closed + 403 ownership checks.\n- No pos"},{"id":"p27s4","text":"tinstall hooks; install/uninstall managed by `dsh plugin`."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"## ✅ Verification"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"Verified on DSH Desktop `@deepseek-ai/dsh 0.1.0-rc.8` (Windows): dual Cordis rows, 15 gated Skills, "},{"id":"p29s2","text":"AgentTeams full lifecycle, sidebar isolation, Feishu end-to-end (boss/staff/group/auto-reply/push/de"},{"id":"p29s3","text":"cision gate), customer-memory merge & isolation, release tarball integrity. See RELEASE_NOTES and Wi"},{"id":"p29s4","text":"ion gate), customer-memory merge & isolation, release tarball integrity. See RELEASE_NOTES and Wiki."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"## 📚 Documentation"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"- Wiki · Quick start · Architecture · Bundle & extension guide\n- FAQ · Troubleshooting · Feishu onbo"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"uick start · Architecture · Bundle & extension guide\n- FAQ · Troubleshooting · Feishu onboarding SOP"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"## 🤝 Contributing"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"PRs welcome — see CONTRIBUTING and CODE_OF_CONDUCT."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
